  "job_B16.10.6.4_20251003_114351": {
    "text": "Halwun hoce on excestre freode h\u00e6gelfl\u00e6de hire wimman \u00fei hy bocte & tilde for hire sawuale crist &\nAmen.\nHer ky\u00f0 on \u00feisse bec \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6ilgyuu gode alysde hig & dunna & heora ofspring, \u00e6t mangode to XIII\n& \u00e6ignulf portgerefa & Godric gupa namon \u00fe\u00e6t toll on manlefes gewittnisse, & on leowerdes healta,\nAnd h\u00e6bbe he godes curs, \u00fee \u00feis \u00e6fre undo a on ecnysse, Amen.\nHer ky\u00f0 on \u00feyssere bec \u00fe\u00e6t godwine blaca bohte hine sylfne & his wyf & his ofspring \u00e6t willelme\nAnd h\u00e6bbe he godes curs \u00fee hit \u00e6fre undo amen.\nHer ky\u00f0 on \u00f0ysse bec \u00fe\u00e6t edwy beorneges sunu lysde hyne and his wif and his cyld on edwerdes\nA kynstanes gewittnesse preost, and a leofsuna gewittnisse a wunforda & an \u00e6lfrices hwita & on\nHer ky\u00f0 on \u00feissere bec \u00fe\u00e6t ediuuu s\u00e6uugeles laf bohte gladu \u00e6t colewine wy\u00f0 healfe punde to cepe\nAnd \u00e6lword portgerefa nam \u00fe\u00e6t toll.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6r to was gewitniss leowine leowordes bro\u00f0or & \u00e6lwi blaca & \u00e6lwine se cyng & land byriht &\nAmen.\nHer cy\u00f0 on \u00feisse bec \u00fe\u00e6t brihtm\u00e6r \u00e6t holacumbe h\u00e6f\u00f0 geboht hine & \u00e6lfgifu his wif & hira cild, &\nOn dudemannes gewitnisse preostes on exancestre & on leofwines preostes on hwita stane, & on\nAnd h\u00e6bbe he cristes curs & sancta marian & sanctus petre \u00fee \u00feis \u00e6fre undo.\nAnd on ealles \u00fe\u00e6s hundrides gewitnisse on exancestre.",
